@startuml
title Panini — build Vite preparado para primeiro acesso offline
actor "Navegador" as Client
participant "Service Worker v2" as SW
participant "Build / index.html" as HTML
database "CacheStorage panini v2" as Cache
database "localStorage" as Local
Client -> SW : install()
SW -> HTML : buscar index.html gerado
HTML --> SW : scripts/css /assets com hash
SW -> Cache : addAll(app shell, JS, CSS, JSON, ícones)
SW -> Client : skipWaiting/claim
Client -> Local : salvar figurinha
Client -> Client : desligar rede
Client -> SW : navigation GET /
SW -> Cache : fallback /
Cache --> Client : HTML
Client -> SW : GET bundle JS/CSS e dados JSON
SW -> Cache : arquivos precacheados
Cache --> Client : resposta offline
Local --> Client : coleção preservada
note bottom
Não inclui garantia offline para imagens externas/CDN.
Testar Chromium com Vite preview build; sem deploy.
end note
@enduml
